{'symbol': 'XOM', 'date': '2022-01-28 15:00:00', 'title': 'EXXONMOBIL APPOINTS JENNIFER DRISCOLL AS VICE PRESIDENT OF INVESTOR RELATIONS; STEPHEN LITTLETON TO RETIRE', 'text': "IRVING, TEXAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--EXXONMOBIL SAID TODAY THAT JENNIFER DRISCOLL HAS BEEN APPOINTED VICE PRESIDENT OF INVESTOR RELATIONS, EFFECTIVE FEB. 7, REPLACING STEPHEN LITTLETON, WHO HAS ELECTED TO RETIRE AFTER 30 YEARS OF SERVICE. “WE WELCOME JENNIFER TO EXXONMOBIL AND WILL LEVERAGE HER KNOWLEDGE AND EXPERIENCE TO ENHANCE OUR COMMUNICATION WITH SHAREHOLDERS,” SAID KATHRYN MIKELLS, SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER. “I'D LIKE TO THANK STEPHEN FOR HIS MANY CONTRIBUTIONS TO THE"}